  "[AirbaseWarheads]x": "x",
  "[HQMessages]... and remember, they can still shoot back. Don't make it easy for them.": "...记住，他们也能还击。别让他们轻易得手。",
  "[HQMessages]...Shit.": "……该死。",
  "[HQMessages]A BDF engineer team is currently trying to recover a pair of tanks that were immobilised in yesterday's fighting.": "一支 BDF 工兵队正试图回收两辆在昨日战斗中瘫痪的坦克。",
  "[HQMessages]A large convoy of fuel trucks was last spotted about 5km north of Dustbowl. We're headed to the convoy's last known position.": "一队油罐车队之前在沙暴以北约5km处被发现了。我们正前往车队的最后已知位置。",
  "[HQMessages]AAAHGRPL-%^$*&": "啊啊啊啊我L-%^$*&",
  "[HQMessages]All enemy R9 systems are neutralised. Head back to the ships to re-arm.": "所有敌方 R9 系统均已清除。返回舰船处补充弹药。",
  "[HQMessages]Alright Aegis 1-1, you're coming up on the first of the flight waypoints.": "好了 Aegis 1-1，你马上要到达第一个飞行航路点。",
  "[HQMessages]Alright, you've just passed waypoint 1. Looks like PALA took notice, seeing a lot of activity north of Ignus.": "好了，你刚刚通过了 1 号航路点。看来 PALA 注意到了，伊格尼斯以北出现了大量活动。",
  "[HQMessages]As usual, you'll be staying out of Feldspar's ADIZ. We don't want to spark an international incident here.": "和往常一样，你要留在长石防空识别区之外。我们可不想在这里引发国际事件。",
  "[HQMessages]Convoy has been spotted. Lets get to work.": "发现车队，开始干活。",
  "[HQMessages]Drop the bombs when the countdown reaches zero and the arrows on your HUD converge.": "当倒计时归零且 HUD 上的箭头汇聚时投弹。",
  "[HQMessages]Enemy radar will be picking you up any second now. Go ahead and let 'em know we're here, make sure to say \"cheese\" for the Primevans.": "敌方雷达随时会发现你。尽管让他们知道我们来了，记得对普里梅瓦人摆好姿势\"拍照\"。",
  "[HQMessages]Excellent work, every convoy vehicle has been destroyed.": "干得好，所有车队载具均已被摧毁。",
  "[HQMessages]Excellent work. The enemy airfield has been razed once again.": "干得好。敌方机场再次被夷为平地。",
  "[HQMessages]Feldspar International Airport has been captured by Boscali Defense Force": "长石国际机场已被波斯卡利国防军占领",
  "[HQMessages]Feldspar is offering access to their munitions, fuel, and repair equipment. Feel free to land at the International Airport if you get damaged, need to rearm, or change your loadout.": "长石愿意开放他们的弹药、燃油和维修设备。如果你受损、需要补充弹药或更换挂载，随时可以在国际机场降落。",
  "[HQMessages]Form up on me and I'll lead us to the target.": "跟上我，我带你们去目标。",
  "[HQMessages]Good hits. We'll finish off any remaining vehicles with our guns. Remember to pull up. Don't get so fixated on shooting that you forget the terrain exists.": "命中得好。我们用机炮解决任何剩余的载具。记得拉起来。别太专注于射击而忘了地形存在。",
  "[HQMessages]Good shooting. That's the last of them. We should clear out before any response comes our way.": "射得好。这是最后一个。我们应在任何反击到来前撤离。",
  "[HQMessages]Good work. Next up is the dangerous bit. Continue along the highway south, use the foothills as cover.": "干得好。接下来是危险的部分。继续沿公路向南，利用山体作为掩护。",
  "[HQMessages]Hang on, getting a message, let me check it and I'll be back with you.": "等一下，有消息进来，我看一下再回来跟你说。",
  "[HQMessages]Headed to the target now.": "现在前往目标。",
  "[HQMessages]I know you're a reservist and you only signed up to fly high and look pretty for enemy radars, but you're the only aircraft in the area that's ready for combat.": "我知道你是预备役，当初报名只是为了飞得高高的、给敌方雷达当个好看的靶子，但你是这片区域里唯一做好战斗准备的飞机。",
  "[HQMessages]I'm linking the Feldspar IFFs to ours, do whatever you can to repel PALA from the island. We cannot afford a second front being opened up.": "我正在把长石的敌我识别码接到我们这边，尽你所能把 PALA 赶出这座岛。我们承受不起再开一条战线。",
  "[HQMessages]Jesus, the hell was that?": "老天，那到底是什么？",
  "[HQMessages]Just hang in there, we're scrambling the rest of Aegis Squadron. They'll be up in a few minutes.": "先撑住，我们正在紧急出动 Aegis 中队的其余飞机。他们几分钟内就会升空。",
  "[HQMessages]Land on the back of one of the corvettes to re-arm. You will be assisting the attack on the airfield.": "降落在其中一艘护卫舰的尾部以补给弹药。你将协助对机场的攻击行动。",
  "[HQMessages]Land on the back of one of the ships to re-arm. You will be assisting the attack on the airfield.": "在其中一艘船的尾部降落以补充弹药。你将协助攻击机场。",
  "[HQMessages]Looks like an oil rig just detonated. Blowout maybe? Looks a little too sudden for that though...": "看起来有座石油钻井平台刚刚爆炸了。也许是井喷？不过看起来太突然了些……",
  "[HQMessages]Nuclear weapon launched, exclusion zone active!": "核武器已发射，禁区生效！",
  "[HQMessages]Okay, Feldspar is currently requesting assistance on all BDF frequencies, PALA's launched an invasion of the island.": "好吧，长石正在所有 BDF 频道上请求支援，PALA 已经对这座岛发动了入侵。",
  "[HQMessages]Once you've taken off, follow the highway south through the mountains.": "起飞后，沿着公路向南穿过山脉。",
  "[HQMessages]Our task is to interrupt them. They are without any air defence, and should be easy pickings.": "我们的任务是打断他们。他们没有任何防空力量，应该很容易对付。",
  "[HQMessages]PALA has recently taken receipt of several R9 Stratolance batteries to prevent us from carrying out bombing raids.": "PALA 最近部署了几个 R9 平流层之矛导弹连，以阻止我们进行轰炸突袭。",
  "[HQMessages]Quite a lot, actually. I don't think I've ever seen this much activity on one of these force projection flights.": "确实相当多。我想我从没在这种兵力投送飞行中见过这么大的活动量。",
  "[HQMessages]SAM Site 1 is neutralised.": "SAM 阵地 1 已清除。",
  "[HQMessages]SAM Site 2 is neutralised.": "SAM 阵地 2 已清除。",
  "[HQMessages]Scramble! A pair of enemy bombers has been spotted releasing cruise missiles, targeting North Boscali Airbase. Shoot the missiles down before they destroy friendly facilities.": "紧急出动！发现两架敌方轰炸机正在发射巡航导弹，目标是北波斯卡利空军基地。在它们摧毁友军设施前把导弹打下来。",
  "[HQMessages]Tactical nuclear weapons are cleared for deployment": "战术核武器已获准部署",
  "[HQMessages]Targets marked. Bombers are now inbound.": "目标已标记。轰炸机现在正在进入。",
  "[HQMessages]The BDF is on the run, and trying to evacuate as much fuel from the area as they can.": "BDF 正在逃窜，试图尽可能多地从该地区撤出燃料。",
  "[HQMessages]The base has been hit!": "基地被击中了！",
  "[HQMessages]The enemy installation has been removed, mission accomplished!": "敌方设施已被摧毁，任务完成！",
  "[HQMessages]The first target area is the supply depot just over this crest. We expect no significant resistance here.": "第一个目标区域就是这个山脊后面的补给站。预计此处无重大抵抗。",
  "[HQMessages]The vehicles should be targetable now. Select them as targets.": "现在应该可以锁定载具了。将它们选为目标。",
  "[HQMessages]Today we'll be destroying all of them, and carrying out a bombing raid.": "今天我们将摧毁它们全部，并执行一次轰炸突袭。",
  "[HQMessages]Warning": "警告",
  "[HQMessages]We'll be targeting a supply point for the R9 systems as well as several active batteries. Staying low and fast will be key.": "我们的目标是 R9 系统的补给点以及几个处于活跃状态的导弹连，保持低空高速很关键。",
  "[HQMessages]We're going to open with bombs. Switch weapons to your PAB-250s, and start a shallow climb to": "我们先用炸弹开场。切换武器到你的 PAB-250，开始浅爬升到",
  "[HQMessages]Whatever the case, keep doing what you're doing. Let 'em know Ignus isn't free for the taking. Just don't fire back unless fired upon.": "不管怎样，继续你正在做的事。让他们知道伊格尼斯不是随便就能拿走的。除非遭到攻击，否则不要还击。",
  "[HQMessages]Work quickly": "动作要快",
  "[HQMessages]Your aircraft's visual sensors can detect ground vehicles within a range of 6km. We are to locate and destroy the convoy.": "你飞机的视觉传感器可以在 6km范围内探测地面载具。我们需要定位并摧毁车队。",
  "[HQMessages]it looks like PALA is scrambling jets from the target airfield.": "看起来 PALA 正从目标机场紧急起飞喷气机。",
